f it in a finite time and reaches the singularity $13\\,k/c$ after passing $ku = 1$. The faint vertical lines are the spheres of areal radius $4k$, $2k$, $1.5\\,k$, and $k$, at $ku = 0.31$, $0.83$, $1.4$, and $2.8$."],"source":{"fields":["coords","parameters","metric_components","inverse_metric_components","kretschmann","domains"],"version":"1c9f5b42a7c60568"},"areal":[{"level":1.0,"lines":[[[0.6969,0.0],[0.6969,1.0]]]},{"level":1.5,"lines":[[[0.3503,0.0],[0.3503,1.0]]]},{"level":2.0,"lines":[[[0.2087,0.0],[0.2087,1.0]]]},{"level":4.0,"lines":[[[0.0777,0.0],[0.0777,1.0]]]}],"slices":[{"view":"equator","surface":0,"label":"$t = 0$","version":"20094a833515d376","lines":[[[0.036,0.5],[1.0,0.5]]],"points":[],"fills":[],"place":{"at":[1.0,0.5],"anchor":"br","dx":0,"dy":-1.3}}]}]}}
